                                "sense_id": "34b1304d-34b3-3b59-8a06-0c670bdf979a",
                                "text": "Bruzz do anything for the huzz"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d06e3ab1-44f9-48af-9cdb-a778f5b88e3e",
                                "sense_id": "34b1304d-34b3-3b59-8a06-0c670bdf979a",
                                "text": "Hell yeah, so look, you get the huzz and you let me know nigga"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3053d853-e7a7-40d5-9030-0288d4b02b73",
                                "sense_id": "34b1304d-34b3-3b59-8a06-0c670bdf979a",
                                "text": "Well, it's actually quite simple. \"Huzz\" is basically a new way of saying \"hoes,\" or \"w---es,\" in reference to women — typically young women. And just like the term \"hoes,\" it can be used in an offensive manner to degrade or generalize women, which is why some aren't too fond of the new slang."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b57633fb-e893-4356-bcc0-13148f89d294",
                                "sense_id": "34b1304d-34b3-3b59-8a06-0c670bdf979a",
                                "text": "Impressing the huzz, doing things for the huzz, blending in with the huzz."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4278bc9-f2d1-4d85-a3d4-6d6f4abb6844",
                                "sense_id": "34b1304d-34b3-3b59-8a06-0c670bdf979a",
                                "text": "I was rizzing up the huzz\nAll swallowing mangos\nWith still water stuck in their throats"
                            }
                        ]
